  /\ bytes_at asegs m (shad (AB + 2048)) (ushadow n)
  /\ bytes_at asegs m (shad AB) (farun (2048 / 8))
  /\ bytes_at asegs m (shad (AB + 2048 + ru8 n)) (farun ((S - 2048 - ru8 n) / 8))
  /\ depot_rep (fst (depot_put D tr)) BK DNB SSB m.

